[en.FOCUS_C08_ENIO]
Lost Science Research Institute

[en.FOCUS_C08_ENIO_desc]
In the Nexus, there is a knowledge that has never been heard of in the world — §OLost Science§!.\n\nWhat is Lost Science? Is it a magic that can revive the dead ponies? Or is it a time-traveling spell that can change the present? Or is it a spell that can turn everything into teacups? We need to learn, to explore, and to establish a special department to research this unknown knowledge.

[en.FOCUS_C08_ENIO_TOOLTIP]
Unlock a series of decisions: §YLost Science Research Institute§!

[zh.FOCUS_C08_ENIO]
失落科学研究院

[zh.FOCUS_C08_ENIO_desc]
除一般的魔法外，我们发现一种全新的知识——§O失落科学§!。\n\n失落科学究竟是什么，是将逝去的小马再度复活的魔法？还是穿越时空，扭转现在的杀器？还是把一切事物变成茶杯的法术？我们需要学习，需要探索，需要一个专门的部门去研究这一未知的知识。

[zh.FOCUS_C08_ENIO_TOOLTIP]
解锁系列决议：§Y失落科学研究院§!

